  "instance_name": "pun_on_plane",
  "label": "Pun on 'plane' (airplane) and 'plane hilarious'",
  "description": "A wordplay that exploits the homophonic similarity between 'plane' (as in airplane) and 'plane' (as in flat or level). The joke 'but their just, plane hilarious' uses this pun to mock the gravity of the 9/11 event by suggesting the tragedy is 'just plane hilarious,' which is a deliberately insensitive and trivializing joke.",
